{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06599","headline":"羣鸦咏 · 储光羲","name":"羣鸦咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新宫骊山阴，龙衮时出豫。\n朝阳照羽仪，清吹肃逵路。\n羣鸦随天车，夜满新丰树。\n所思在腐余，不复忧霜露。\n河低宫阁深，灯影鼓钟曙。\n缤纷集寒枝，矫翼时相顾。\n冢宰收琳琅，侍臣尽鸳鹭。\n高举摩太清，永绝矰缴惧。\n兹禽亦翱翔，不以微小故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}